    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mullery O’Gara are pleased to present 47 Morehampton Road to the market. A Victorian red brick bay windowed family home c. 194 SqM / 2,088 Sq Ft. Well set back from the road with carport to rear and access to Morehampton Terrace. \r\n\r\nCarefully maintained throughout, extended to rear with wonderful proportions and original features. \r\n\r\nEnviable location on this much sought after tree lined road beside Ranelagh and Donnybrook villages with their wide selection of artisan shops, cafes, bars and restaurants. Within 10 minutes walk are St Stephen’s Green, Baggot St, and Ballsbridge.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises of entrance hallway, two interconnecting reception rooms, open plan kitchen/living/dining to rear. Downstairs w.c/whb, utility room, study/laundry room. \r\n\r\nOn the first floor return is the bathroom and door to south west facing sun terrace. On the first floor are three bedrooms and stairs to bedroom 4 and bathroom. \r\n\r\nOutside is a well stocked front garden. Low maintenance rear garden with carport. \r\n\r\nThe property is beside numerous bus routes on the QBC on your doorstep along with AirCoach linking directly to Dublin Airport. Morehampton Road is also within easy walking distance of the city centre. For recreational facilities leisure clubs and parks and plentiful in the area with Dartmouth Square Park, Herbert Park, Yoga Dublin, numerous gyms, Fitzwilliam LTC and Mount Pleasant LTC in the immediate area."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hallway \r\nCeiling coving, dado rail, understairs storage and cloaks. \r\n\r\nLounge\r\nMarble mantlepiece, ceiling coving and centre rose. Bay window and folding doors to \r\n\r\nDiningroom \r\nMarble mantlepiece, ceiling coving and centre rose\r\n\r\nKitchen \r\nRange of overhead and undercounter units, marble worktop, sink unit, plumbed for dishwasher and stainless steel extractor fan. Island unit with additional storage. Tiled floor, recessed lights and opening to \r\n\r\nLivingroom \r\nWood flooring, Apex glazed roof. \r\n\r\nBreakfast room \r\nWood flooring, gas stove, French doors and windows to patio. \r\n\r\nGuest w.c \r\nW.c, whb, tiled floor and recessed lights. \r\n\r\nUtility \r\nSink unit, plumbed for washing machine, recessed lights and door to side. \r\n\r\nStudy/Laundry room \r\nWood flooring, C.H boiler and water cylinder. \r\n\r\n1st floor return \r\nBathroom \r\nBath, separate shower, twin sink unit with solid wood vanity unit, tiled floor and part tiled walls. Door to private terrace. \r\n\r\n1st floor \r\nBedroom 1 (Rear)\r\nWall to wall fitted wardrobe with glazed doors, ceiling coving, centre rose and dado rail. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (Front)\r\nMarble mantlepiece and picture rail. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3 (Front) \r\nPicture rail. \r\n\r\nStairs to \r\nLanding \r\nFitted close and recessed lights. \r\n\r\nBedroom 4 \r\nTwo dormer windows, fitted wardrobe and eaves storage. \r\n\r\nBathroom  \r\nBath with shower attachment, w.c, whb, towel radiator, shower, recessed lights, tiled floor and part tiled walls. \r\n\r\nOutside \r\nFront gardens in lawn with box hedging, variety of shrubs and trees. \r\nRear paved south west facing garden with bedding, shrubs, hedging. Outside lights, tap and uplighters. Carport with automatic shutter to vehicular laneway off Morehampton Terrace."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "c. 194 SqM / 2,088 Sq Ft\r\nGFCH. \r\nCarport to rear – 4.8 x 6.9m.\r\nSouth West aspect. \r\nGenerously proportioned. \r\nNumerous bus routes on your doorstep incl Aircoach \r\nLocated beside Herbert Park.\r\nWithin easy reach of the villages of Donnybrook and Ranelagh.\r\nBeside a host of primary and secondary schools.\r\nEasy access to city centre."
      },
